	(text "BUS_OUT and VUSB are drawn twice: U14 drives BUS_OUT from the boost and U17 passes it on to USB-C (OTG); 5 V fed in at the M5-Bus (pin 28) or Grove port A (J3 pin 3) reaches VBUS through U19. BUS_OUT_EN and USB_OTG_EN (AW9523B) pick the direction."
